# 🌾 Sri Lanka Paddy Production Prediction — Frontend Specification

> **Version**: 1.0 | **Date**: February 2026
> Share this document with your frontend developer to build the web application.

---

## 1. Project Overview

Build a **bilingual (English + Sinhala)** web application for Sri Lankan farmers and agricultural officers to predict paddy `Total Production (MT)` for any district and season using a trained ML model.

### Target Users
- Sri Lankan farmers (mobile-first)
- Agricultural officers (desktop)
- Policy planners

### Core Features
1. **Predict** — Enter cultivation inputs → get production prediction (MT)
2. **Explain** — See top 5 reasons why the model made that prediction (SHAP)
3. **About** — Information about the model, accuracy, and how to use it

---

## 2. Backend API

The backend is a **FastAPI** server running at:

```
http://localhost:8000
```

In production, replace with the deployed server URL.

### 2.1 GET `/health`

Check if the API is alive.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "ok",
  "model": "CatBoost",
  "api_version": "1.0.0"
}
```

---

### 2.2 POST `/predict`

Predict Total Paddy Production for one district/season.

**Request body (JSON):**
```json
{
  "Year": 2023,
  "Season": "Yala",
  "District": "AMPARA",
  "Sown_Major": 60510,
  "Sown_Minor": 2308,
  "Sown_Rainfed": 366,
  "Sown_Total": 63184,
  "Harvest_Major": 60506,
  "Harvest_Minor": 2304,
  "Harvest_Rainfed": 366,
  "Harvest_Total": 63176,
  "Yield_Major": 4358,
  "Yield_Minor": 3986,
  "Yield_Rainfed": 3251,
  "Yield_Avg": 4338,
  "Nett_Extent": 60377
}
```

**All numeric fields are optional** — missing values will be auto-imputed by the model. Only `Year`, `Season`, and `District` are required.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "predicted_total_production_mt": 261938.0,
  "model_used": "CatBoost",
  "input_summary": {
    "Year": 2023,
    "Season": "Yala",
    "District": "AMPARA"
  }
}
```

---

### 2.3 POST `/explain`

Same input as `/predict` — additionally returns top-5 SHAP feature contributions.

**Request body:** Same as `/predict`

**Response:**
```json
{
  "predicted_total_production_mt": 261938.0,
  "base_value_mt": 45231.5,
  "top_features": [
    { "feature": "Nett_Extent",    "shap_value": 98432.1, "direction": "increases" },
    { "feature": "Harvest_Total",  "shap_value": 52110.3, "direction": "increases" },
    { "feature": "Sown_Total",     "shap_value": 38900.7, "direction": "increases" },
    { "feature": "Yield_Avg",      "shap_value": 21450.2, "direction": "increases" },
    { "feature": "Season",         "shap_value": -5823.6, "direction": "decreases" }
  ],
  "model_used": "CatBoost"
}
```

`shap_value` = how many MT this feature **adds or subtracts** from the base prediction.
`direction` = `"increases"` (positive) or `"decreases"` (negative).

---

## 3. Input Field Reference

| Field | Label (English) | Label (Sinhala) | Unit | Type | Nullable |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `Year` | Year | වර්ෂය | — | Integer (2005–2030) | No |
| `Season` | Season | කන්නය | — | "Yala" or "Maha" | No |
| `District` | District | දිස්ත්‍රික්කය | — | String (see list) | No |
| `Sown_Major` | Major Scheme — Sown Extent | ප්‍රධාන යෝජනා ක්‍රමය — බිම් කොටස (හෙ.) | Hectares | Float | Yes |
| `Sown_Minor` | Minor Scheme — Sown Extent | කුඩා යෝජනා ක්‍රමය — බිම් කොටස (හෙ.) | Hectares | Float | Yes |
| `Sown_Rainfed` | Rain-fed — Sown Extent | වර්ෂාපෝෂිත — බිම් කොටස (හෙ.) | Hectares | Float | Yes |
| `Sown_Total` | Total Sown Extent | මුළු වගා කළ බිම් කොටස (හෙ.) | Hectares | Float | Yes |
| `Harvest_Major` | Major Scheme — Harvested | ප්‍රධාන — අස්වනු කළ බිම් (හෙ.) | Hectares | Float | Yes |
| `Harvest_Minor` | Minor Scheme — Harvested | කුඩා — අස්වනු කළ බිම් (හෙ.) | Hectares | Float | Yes |
| `Harvest_Rainfed` | Rain-fed — Harvested | වර්ෂාපෝෂිත — අස්වනු කළ (හෙ.) | Hectares | Float | Yes |
| `Harvest_Total` | Total Harvested Extent | මුළු අස්වනු කළ බිම් (හෙ.) | Hectares | Float | Yes |
| `Yield_Major` | Major Scheme — Average Yield | ප්‍රධාන — සාමාන්‍ය අස්වනු (kg/ha) | kg/ha | Float | Yes |
| `Yield_Minor` | Minor Scheme — Average Yield | කුඩා — සාමාන්‍ය අස්වනු (kg/ha) | kg/ha | Float | Yes |
| `Yield_Rainfed` | Rain-fed — Average Yield | වර්ෂාපෝෂිත — සාමාන්‍ය අස්වනු (kg/ha) | kg/ha | Float | Yes |
| `Yield_Avg` | Overall Average Yield | සාමාන්‍ය අස්වනු (kg/ha) | kg/ha | Float | Yes |
| `Nett_Extent` | Net Harvested Extent | නිශ්චිත අස්වනු කළ බිම් (හෙ.) | Hectares | Float | Yes |

> ℹ️ **Note**: All nullable fields can be left blank. The model will use historical median values for that district automatically.

