## 8. Recommended Tech Stack

| Layer | Recommended | Alternatives |
|---|---|---|
| Framework | React + Vite | Next.js, plain HTML |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS or plain CSS | Bootstrap |
| Charts (SHAP bars) | Recharts or Chart.js | D3.js, Nivo |
| HTTP client | Axios or fetch | — |
| Deployment | Vercel / Netlify | GitHub Pages |

